      "typeDetails": null,
      "abstract": {
        "text": "A string that describes a place’s match status with Points of Interest (POI) in Apple Maps. `PENDING` indicates that Apple Maps is currently matching the place to a POI. `MATCHED` indicates that the provided place information matched a POI, and `NO_MATCH` indicates that the place doesn’t match a POI in Apple Maps or is in a location not supported by Apple Maps.",
